WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
The SA node starts the impulse.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
The AV node briefly delays conduction.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.500
The AV bundle connects atria and ventricles.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Bundle branches and Purkinje fibers distribute the impulse.
